，景深适中。\n前排坐着5人：\n最左侧白发老奶奶，酒红色暗纹长款旗袍，珍珠项链，端坐木圈椅，双手放在腿上；\n第二位中年女士，墨绿色暗纹长款旗袍，外搭白色毛皮披肩，多层珍珠项链，复古盘发，坐在中式木椅上；\n第三位中年男士，黑色暗纹中式唐装上衣，白色暗纹阔腿长衫，坐在木椅；\n第四位中年男士，灰色长款立领长衫，白色袖口，黑色皮鞋，端坐木椅；\n后排站立3人：\n后排左一男士，白色衬衫+棕色暗纹西装马甲，深色西裤；\n后排中间男士，白色衬衫+灰色暗纹西装马甲，深色西裤；\n后排右一年轻女子，白色改良旗袍，黑色盘扣绣花，盘发配珍珠发饰；\n人物中间摆放一张小木茶几，上面放一对白瓷青花小茶杯，中式实木圈椅，所有人表情自然温和，正视镜头，姿态端庄，构图均衡，传统大家庭合影，色彩温润复古，无畸变，画面干净，胶片人像质感。\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "id": 13, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "links": [17], "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}], "size": [300, 120], "pos": [2261.25634765625, 1640.654052734375], "widgets_values": [1024, 1024, 1], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "width"}, "name": "width", "link": 18, "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "宽度"}, {"widget": {"name": "height"}, "name": "height", "link": 19, "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "高度"}, {"widget": {"name": "batch_size"}, "name": "batch_size", "label": "batch_size", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "批次大小"}], "flags": {}, "id": 16, "type": "EmptyLatentImage", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.36.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {"width": true, "height": true}, "Node name for S&R": "EmptyLatentImage"}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "INT", "links": [18], "label": "整数", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "整数"}], "size": [270, 58], "pos": [1876.5155029296875, 1423.9473876953125], "widgets_values": [1280], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "id": 17, "type": "Int", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Int"}, "order": 7}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "INT", "links": [19], "label": "整数", "type": "INT", "localized_nam